  <item>
    <title>EP23 假如人生是星露谷就好了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6963a455e235ea65bc49f4fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6963a455e235ea65bc49f4fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Jan 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：人间百草枯 Iris</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是2026年的第一期节目，由《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64f7ce8b37e1b72194cda03b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64f7ce8b37e1b72194cda03b"><span>就决定是你了</span></a><span>》百草枯与《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64e4614103cf244602c782cf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64e4614103cf244602c782cf"><span>自灯明</span></a><span>》Iris为大家呈现。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 开篇抛出一个问题：《星露谷物语》到底拥有怎样的魔力，能吸引到我们两个完全不同的游戏玩家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">3:49</a> 我们各自是如何遇见星露谷的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 《星露谷物语》游戏内容简介以及我们踩过的那些坑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 我们的星露谷搞钱大法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 关于宠物。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 你选择社区中心还是选择JOJA超市呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">59:18</a> 姜岛，我们的梦幻家园。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4033">67:13</a> 我们在星露谷的婚姻生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5254">87:34</a> 星露谷里的爱情观。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5574">92:54</a> 礼物与朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5758">95:58</a> 如果我们两个性转一下，会各自选择哪位伴侣呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6406">106:46</a> 你最喜欢星露谷的哪个季节？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7234">120:34</a> 你最喜欢星露谷的哪个节日？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7981">133:01</a> 关于mod与作弊。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4614103cf244602c782cf/lqwq0zDLP_czUKm8Mc8ki9XBRIou.m4a" length="127397717" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:39:20</itunes:duration>
