  <item>
    <title>EP22 假如你被命运扔进滚筒洗衣机，该怎么办？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e26d438e321a0d6f00e484</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e26d438e321a0d6f00e484</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久好久没见了，大家好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目算是回归预热吧，汇报一下2025年被命运扔进滚筒洗衣机蹂躏的观察体会~希望命运能对大家都好一点！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 面对强烈的失控感，一个字：等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>唯一能做的主，只有向下的主，只能选择玉石俱焚or放弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>任何百折不挠的人，现将获得我最高等级的尊敬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a>祸福相依</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>焦虑的时候不要“想”，只管去“做”，真的能缓解坏情绪吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>失去比拥有让人更安心。我们追求的东西有时是自相矛盾的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>讨厌社交也许是因为长期失权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a>人人都想做苏轼黄庭坚，但大多数人其实是秦观：懂得很多豁达的道理但依然纠结。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>《臣服实验》--世界不因个人喜恶而改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>《活出不羁人生》 --执念&amp;抵抗</span></p><span></span><p><span>《如何从敌人身上获益》--朴素真理</span></p><span></span><p><span>《地下室手记》--阴暗爬行</span></p><span></span><p><span>《罪与罚》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《北郊》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>~~~啊啊啊啊啊命运吶，为什么这样，折磨着我~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4614103cf244602c782cf/lq0uvaQVIUgdy0R5sRohvwgVeECn.m4a" length="37097948" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGFgZOYA524eO3X9-2NrEUaAHpm.png"/>
